This repository stores Roblox knowledge, not game source code.

1. Start with [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md). Do **not** read every document.
2. Open only the task-matched sections of the canonical file. For broad/multi-domain questions, first use [AI_CONTEXT.md](../../AI_CONTEXT.md).
3. Reuse citations and dated research; search web only for fresh or missing facts. Do not repeat video transcription or broad scans.
4. Never invent metrics, confirm Studio access before claiming tests, validate economy on server, and do not spend ad credits or publish without explicit user authorization.
